:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">영어 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">19, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">스페인어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3)  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">근무기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022. 9. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 9. 23.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) / 9. 19.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 9. 27.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">      </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">참가 국가별 입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">출국 일정에 따라 기간 변동 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">행사 전후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1~2</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 49.6pt; text-indent: -49.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">      </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">코로나 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">등 전염병 발생 상황에 따라 축제가 취소되거나 온라인 개최로 변경될 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">모집 일정은 전면 취소될 수 있음  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">근무내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">해외 팀의 한국 입국부터 출국까지 모든 일정 동행하며 통역  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">지원내역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">통역지원금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">70,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">숙박 및 식사 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">활동증명서 발급 등  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">접수 및 면접  </span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">재모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2022. 7. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 7. 31.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">모집대상  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">      </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">전국 대학교 재학생으로 외국어 가능자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">중급 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.4pt; text-indent: -18.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">      </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">○ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2022. 9. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 9. 23.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)